<title>GERMANY: Cologne airport Feb passenger traffic up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Cologne airport Feb passenger traffic up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger traffic at Cologne/Bonn airport rose 10 percent year-on-year to 341,426 travellers in February, the German airport association ADV said.</p>
<p>Travel to European destinations rose more than 20 percent while overseas travel fell 6.6 percent, the ADV monthly traffic report showed.</p>
<p>The following tables show 1997 passenger details with percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>    Feb 1997			Monthly total	Pct change</p>
<p>    Total				341,426	    Up   10.0</p>
<p>    Domestic			   195,187	    Up    6.2</p>
<p>    Europe			     125,306	    Up   20.3</p>
<p>    Overseas			    15,910	    Down  6.6</p>
<p>    Transit				4,687	    Down  6.5</p>
<p>   Jan-Feb 1997		 Cumulative total    Pct change</p>
<p>    Total				686,334	    Up   11.2</p>
<p>    Domestic			   382,151	    Up    6.0</p>
<p>    Europe			     254,844	    Up   25.1</p>
<p>    Overseas			    35,846	    Down 15.2</p>
<p>    Transit			     12,834	    Up   33.7</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
